                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is well worth the $3 I spent. \n\nMultiple rooms with dedicated musical themes, such as rock, electronicia etc. \n\nAudio is responsive with no noticeable lag and the back ground visualisations are nice. \n\nIt currently seems to lack depth for any \"real\" audio production but it is still in early access so hopefully it gets a few more features/customisation. \n\nI would recommend any creative people with VR headsets give this a shot.",
